  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Edson Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Edson Pina here. Sorry, I'm on speakerphone, I've got my hands full out here. Can you hear me okay? [inaudible]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You sound like you're in a tunnel, but I can follow you. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I was up early, got my coffee, walked out to bring in the bins, and the pile is still sitting there at the curb. Same pile."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What kind of pile is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk stuff. My landlord cleared out the downstairs unit after the tenants moved out and left a mattress, a couple of chairs, a broken table, all of it, out on the curb. Nobody took it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty Coggeshall Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty Coggeshall, got it. Has the trash truck been by since it went out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, they got the regular trash, they just skipped the pile. That's the second miss in a row now. [line breaks up] Last week they skipped it too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, you broke up on me there. Was that the second pickup they've left it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:59:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, second pickup in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll put in a request for a bulk pickup check at that address and flag that it's been missed twice. Is this number the best one to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, four oh one, five five five, oh one eight six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Someone will follow up with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks Denise. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T15:00:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
